  data                  data tooling commands
  demos                 demos tooling commands
  deploy                deploy tooling commands
  diagnostics           diagnostics tooling commands
  docs                  Generate markdown reference documentation from...
  foundry               foundry tooling commands
  graph                 Render the declared tool dependency graph.
  lint                  lint tooling commands
  list                  List registered tools and lifecycle metadata.
  migrations            migrations tooling commands
  ops-experiments       ops-experiments tooling commands
  release               release tooling commands
  report-timing         Summarize recent tool timing records and budget...
  research-experiments  research-experiments tooling commands
  runtime               runtime tooling commands
  testing               testing tooling commands
